@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
autonumber
actor "Integrator / service manager" as Manager
participant "Old process" as Old
participant "New Linux runner" as Host
participant "Bundle adapter" as Bundle
participant "PresenceMonitor" as Core
participant "Atomic JSON writer" as Writer
Manager -> Old : controlled stop; wait for process exit
Old --> Manager : exited; no worker can publish
note over Manager, Old
If shutdown stalls, the service manager terminates
and waits. Do not overlap result-file writers.
end note
Manager -> Host : start with explicit configuration
Host -> Host : establish output, new opaque runtime session
Host -> Writer : unknown / service_starting
Host -> Bundle : verify approved manifest hash, artifacts,\nfeatures, class and operating contract
alt valid bundle and profile
 Bundle --> Host : frozen contract + loaded inference callable
 Host -> Core : construct with plain immutable contract
 Core --> Host : unknown; await new eligible observations
else startup validation fails
 Bundle --> Host : typed rejection reasons
 Host -> Writer : unknown with startup reasons
 Host --> Manager : startup failure
end
note over Host, Core
No hot reload, old history restore or model search.
In-process generation handles evidence invalidation separately.
end note
@enduml
